WEBVTT
NOTE Cedwyn film, frame 012, en. Timings estimated from the script until the clip is rendered (re-split 27 Oct 2026: <=2x42 chars, <=20 cps, <=180 wpm).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.867
<v Nia>Eighteen seventy-seven:
a notice to quit, a sale, a lease.

2
00:00:03.987 --> 00:00:07.145
<v Nia>How much of it can we find on paper?

3
00:00:07.565 --> 00:00:11.631
<v the Bute estate office clerk>Counterpart lease, sixth of
November, eighteen seventy-seven.

4
00:00:11.751 --> 00:00:16.351
<v the Bute estate office clerk>The Bute Trustees to John Williams,
builder, of System Street, Roath.

5
00:00:16.471 --> 00:00:19.629
<v the Bute estate office clerk>A plot in Clyde Street.
Into the Roath box.

6
00:00:20.049 --> 00:00:24.382
<v the Bute estate office clerk>Now the Trustees' abstract of
receipts and payments for the year.

7
00:00:24.502 --> 00:00:27.569
<v the Bute estate office clerk>Every pound in, every
pound out, written fair.

8
00:00:31.989 --> 00:00:36.989
<v The Grandson>The statement of Mary (Nancy) Williams,
typed around nineteen seventy-four.

9
00:00:37.109 --> 00:00:41.709
<v The Grandson>She writes that in eighteen
seventy-seven Bute served notice to quit.

10
00:00:42.129 --> 00:00:44.662
<v Nia>That reaches us through her statement,

11
00:00:44.782 --> 00:00:47.916
<v Nia>as the Legal Wiki's Master
Timeline records it.

12
00:00:48.036 --> 00:00:50.702
<v Nia>We haven't seen any notice paper itself.

13
00:00:51.122 --> 00:00:56.389
<v The Grandson>Then a sale. The farmhouse, the buildings
and about ten acres to Daniel Thomas,

14
00:00:56.509 --> 00:00:58.965
<v The Grandson>with about nine acres kept by Bute.

15
00:00:59.085 --> 00:01:01.685
<v The Grandson>The original deed and plan are missing.

16
00:01:02.105 --> 00:01:06.639
<v Nia>The catalogue links this family-identified
plan image to an eighteen

17
00:01:06.759 --> 00:01:10.959
<v Nia>seventy-seven agreement between
Bute and Daniel Thomas and Son.

18
00:01:11.079 --> 00:01:12.945
<v Nia>We don't hold the agreement.

19
00:01:13.065 --> 00:01:16.223
<v Nia>Sale, or a quarry lease
of the house parcel?

20
00:01:16.343 --> 00:01:19.076
<v Nia>Terms, the plan's standing, any reverter,

21
00:01:19.196 --> 00:01:23.063
<v Nia>whether the deed survives
outside family papers: all open.

22
00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:28.750
<v Nia>So, the money. Bute X.6(12), the Trustees'
abstract for eighteen seventy-seven.

23
00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:33.870
<v Nia>The Case Analysis calls it the decisive
test: a capital receipt means sale,

24
00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:37.323
<v Nia>rent alone means lease,
and perhaps a court order.

25
00:01:37.743 --> 00:01:39.147
<v The Grandson>And we have it?

26
00:01:39.567 --> 00:01:41.567
<v Nia>Not obtained, not transcribed.

27
00:01:41.687 --> 00:01:46.553
<v Nia>And an account book alone wouldn't
settle the legal nature or the extent.

28
00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:51.307
<v The Grandson>Last of all: a lease dated sixth
November eighteen seventy-seven,

29
00:01:51.427 --> 00:01:52.727
<v The Grandson>to John Williams.

30
00:01:53.147 --> 00:01:55.347
<v Nia>No matching Llandough deed found.

31
00:01:55.467 --> 00:02:00.667
<v Nia>DBDT/79/1 was checked: second of May
eighteen seventy-seven, Pembroke Terrace,

32
00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:05.520
<v Nia>Cardiff. Other similarly named Cardiff
leases are catalogue leads only.

33
00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:08.045
<v The Grandson>This one's even the right day.

34
00:02:08.465 --> 00:02:11.265
<v Nia>Same date, Bute Trustees, a John Williams.

35
00:02:11.385 --> 00:02:15.947
<v Nia>But a builder of System Street,
Roath, for a plot in Clyde Street.

36
00:02:16.067 --> 00:02:18.733
<v Nia>Photographed and excluded. Not the farm.

37
00:02:19.153 --> 00:02:21.687
<v Nia>So the November lease stays unlocated.

38
00:02:21.807 --> 00:02:25.940
<v Nia>Without it there's no boundary,
no transfer to the Williamses,

39
00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:28.165
<v Nia>no route to a Cedwyn Estate.

40
00:02:28.285 --> 00:02:30.685
<v Nia>Parties, property, plan, rent, term,

41
00:02:30.805 --> 00:02:34.339
<v Nia>and its link to the Thomas
quarrying are all unknown.

42
00:02:34.759 --> 00:02:37.025
<v The Grandson>Then we keep asking Bute's papers.

43
00:02:37.445 --> 00:02:38.745
<v Nia>Box by box.
